{"4683940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cafe Connect", "steam_appid": 4683940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Information</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Right now, it's being developed solely by me or rather, by just one person!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So please accept my apologies if there are any delays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the English-speaking audience, I'll hire someone to translate the release properly into English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please also note that the “Start from Home” feature is only available in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you'll already own and set up your Internet café by the time the game is released.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683940/extras/e9b70ee54949f20c40dad5ff0e042998.avif?t=1787074152\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to Café Connect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Café Connect(Full Version), you start at the very bottom with a screwdriver, broken PCs, and a small workshop at home. Your first customers bring you their broken, dusty, or outdated computers, and it’s up to you to get them working again. Repair hardware, replace components, upgrade systems, and make sure every device is back to full performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every successful job, you earn money and build your reputation step by step. But that’s just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve earned enough, you’ll open your own internet café. Your first small shop will be built from individual PCs you’ve assembled yourself a place where customers don’t just play games and surf the web, but also become part of your growing story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your café, invest in better hardware, improve your setup, and transform your small shop into a fully equipped high-end gaming internet café. The further you go, the more opportunities open up from better upgrades to larger spaces and new services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Repair, Cleaning, and Upgrades 🔧</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your own internet café ☕</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom PC builds for your customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system: from a small shop to a high-end gaming café</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxed yet motivating tycoon experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Translated with  (free version)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683940/extras/e9b70ee54949f20c40dad5ff0e042998.avif?t=1787074152\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to Café Connect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Café Connect(Full Version), you start at the very bottom with a screwdriver, broken PCs, and a small workshop at home. Your first customers bring you their broken, dusty, or outdated computers, and it’s up to you to get them working again. Repair hardware, replace components, upgrade systems, and make sure every device is back to full performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every successful job, you earn money and build your reputation step by step. But that’s just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve earned enough, you’ll open your own internet café. Your first small shop will be built from individual PCs you’ve assembled yourself a place where customers don’t just play games and surf the web, but also become part of your growing story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your café, invest in better hardware, improve your setup, and transform your small shop into a fully equipped high-end gaming internet café. The further you go, the more opportunities open up from better upgrades to larger spaces and new services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Repair, Cleaning, and Upgrades 🔧</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your own internet café ☕</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom PC builds for your customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system: from a small shop to a high-end gaming café</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxed yet motivating tycoon experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Translated with  (free version)</p>", "short_description": "Repair, upgrade, and build PCs for your first customers to pave your way to self-employment. Open your own internet café, build custom gaming PCs, and expand your shop step by step. Your success starts with a screwdriver.", "supported_languages": "German, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683940/bb509a644439e7bb2a83541b14b4c51c2b97d5c9/header.jpg?t=1787074152", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683940/79d60044ba07cef55b1f9966222c4ce681d3d609/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787074152", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683940/79d60044ba07cef55b1f9966222c4ce681d3d609/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787074152", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>M